 "remarks": "Fabulous colonial in the heart of Silvermine! Set on a private enclave, this impeccably maintained 4 bedroom/2.5 bath residence blends timeless elegance with modern comfort. Sunfilled, spacious rooms flow beautifully throughout, including a gourmet eatin kitchen, a stunning family room with fireplace and vaulted ceilings, and an elegant dining room ideal for both everyday living and entertaining. A Trex deck and walkout lower level with a bluestone patio create exceptional indoor/outdoor living, making this home a true Silvermine standout.",
